# Generated Site UI resolution output, and the staged copy of an external
# module. Linting a distribution's module would report its style violations as
# this repository's; the distribution lints its own tree. `next build` lints
# `src/` with these rules, so a staging directory missing here failed a module's
# image build on a style rule the module never agreed to.
src/site-ui/active
src/site-ui/external
src/generated
